      <div class="card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 01-9 8.5 8.4 8.4 0 01-4.4-1.2L3 20l1.3-5A8.4 8.4 0 0112 3a8.5 8.5 0 019 8.5z"/></svg></span><h3>Ongoing support</h3><p>Available from your first message to the end of your trip. WhatsApp support 7 days a week while you travel.</p></div>
